    "semantic_summary": "The LoadingService is a core utility service responsible for managing a global, application-wide loading indicator state. It encapsulates reactive state using Angular Signals (`visible` and `message`) to signal when asynchronous operations are in progress. Its primary role is to provide a centralized API for other parts of the application to trigger the display and subsequent hiding of the loading overlay, ensuring UI stability during busy periods."
